cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Evidence RAG Pilot"
message: "If you use this technical prototype, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A page-native, traceable retrieval-augmented generation prototype for
  engineering datasheets. The system preserves document identity, page number,
  PDF coordinates, native text, section context, and evidence images as a single
  inspectable evidence package, rather than reducing pages to detached token
  windows.
